OL,3,GNEWSAPolitical battle intensifies
OL,4,Awithin Labour over Rosebank oil field
OL,5,
OL,6,FScottish Labour leader Michael Marra is
OL,7,Fwading into the political battle which
OL,8,Fis intensifying over the Rosebank oil
OL,9,Ffield.
OL,11,FHe is making a direct appeal to Energy
OL,12,FSecretary Miatta Fahnbulleh to approve
OL,13,Fthe plans to allow production to begin
OL,14,Fin the North Atlantic.
OL,16,FEnvironmentalists have long campaigned
OL,17,Fagainst the proposals for drilling in
OL,18,Fthe UK's largest untapped oil field, 80
OL,19,Fmiles north-west of Shetland.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
